Why it is here
--------------
It is the authoritative list of Gambatte's colour palettes, and `npm run palette`
parses it to recolour Game Boy screenshots. It is **build-time tooling only**: it is
not imported by any source file under `src/`, and nothing derived from it is bundled
into the web app, which remains GPL-3.0-or-later. Updating it is a verbatim re-copy
from upstream, nothing more.
